[options]
[A.]
<$PlaySound,shortThunderCrack.wav>
<$PlaySound,ThunderCrack.wav>
<$PlaySound,ThunderQuietDistant.wav>

                                                   <h2>Repelling Hades Forces<a href="#mission12">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>
<i>Repelling Hades Forces is like trying to stop BULF's from BULFing!<br>
                                                                                ---SWELBLANDER, Inc. 98-08-01~[Ipriest.33]</i>
                                                                                      ~[Ibulf.59]<br>
          ~[Ipriest.112]~[Ilightning.0]~[Ianim.10] ~[Ibulf.36]<br>
                                                                               ~[Ibulf.40]     ~1~y<?!{sw_difficulty1}>HARD</?><?{sw_difficulty1}>EASY</?>~.<br>
<br> You must now repel Hades forces from advancing thru Windy City.
 For if they succeed the realm of Nimbus will change as we know it.
 For they will have the knowledge and power of Wind to pass on to all of Hades, Forever!
<p>
                     <a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55"> ~[IfortGump.50] </a>                                          <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">~[IfortGump.22] </a>                                             <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">~[Ipriest.13]</a><br>
          <a href="cmd:ShowTechnology,55">Your Knowledge</a>                              <a href="cmd:DoNothing,0">Evacuate!</a>                                  <a href="cmd:Tell,guideHades.overview">Must Leave</a>
$OnExit= ,PlaySound,PriestMove1.wav
$Button= ,Tell,A.

[@2]
<?!{sw_difficulty1}>
<$ViewSpot,(200x120)>
NO! What has {sw_hades} done?<br>
You look at the bridges...
$OnExit= ,SetAllBridge,2
</?>
<?{sw_difficulty1}>
<$ViewSpot,(200x120)>
NO! What has {sw_hades} done?<br>
You look at the bridges...
$OnExit= ,SetAllBridge,0
</?>

[@3]
<?{sw_difficulty1}>
<$ViewSpot,(200x120)>
HAWHAW! The Spell Backfired!
$Button=A break for us!,DoNothing,0
</?>



[ai3PriestDead][ai4PriestDead][ai5PriestDead][ai6PriestDead][ai7PriestDead][ai2PriestDead]
<$ChangeMoney,1000>
<h2>One of Hades Lost Warriors have become even more lost, <br>
On the altar that is!</h2>
$Button=Fight on!,DoNothing,0


[ai8PriestCaptured]
<h2>You receive a message from {sw_hades}.<br>
<i>Traitorous priest - Give up now and I won't let you suffer!</i>
<p>
Don't give up and Mr. Windy City Ambassador bites it.
$Button=Can't stop now!,DoNothing,0

[ai8PriestDead]
<h2>You receive a message from the {sw_god2}.</h2>
<i>Fear not priest for he was a brave warrior and good leader of his people. <br>
He would want you to fight on!</i>

[ai1TempleDead]
<h2>Looks like you aren't a worthy adversary after all!

[ai1PriestCaptured]
<?{sw_difficulty1}>
<$PlaySound,ChainRattle24.wav>
<h2>EGADS! One of {sw_hades}<h2> slaves has Captured you!</h2>
<p>
         Visions of you chained to {sw_hades} altar fills your mind!<br>
                                            ~[IdaisExtraFrames.8]<br>
<br>
            You hear evil laughter fill your head! It's {sw_hades}!<br>
<br>
  <i>"Ah now Priest, your soul is now mine to torture at will! For your<br>
      insolence and betrayal of me, I guarantee you that you will be<br>
                  sacrificed very slowly and very painfully!"</i>
<p>
    You groan in horror. This is your worst nightmare come true!

$OnExit= ,PlaySound,PriestStruggleFade02-800.wav
<$Config,sw_m12=0>
<$Config,sw_m24=1>
$Button=OnTo HADES ALTAR!,MissionBegin,sw_m24
</?>

<?!{sw_difficulty1}>
<$PlaySound,ChainRattle24.wav>
<h2>EGADS! One of {sw_hades}<h2> slaves has Captured you!</h2>
<p>
         Visions of you chained to {sw_hades} altar fills your mind!<br>
                                            ~[IdaisExtraFrames.8]<br>
<br>
            You hear evil laughter fill your head! It's {sw_hades}!<br>
<br>
<i>"I warn you priest, for your disobediance, you will pay dearly! It's off to the
 depths of destruction for you!"</i>
<$Config,sw_difficulty1=1>
<$Config,sw_mvar0=4000>
<$Config,sw_mvar1=1000>
<$Config,sw_mvar2=6>
<$Config,sw_mvar3=1>
$Button=Try to escape!,Tell,esc
</?>

[esc]
You did it! You escaped from your captor!<br>
Quickly, before {sw_hades} finds out, try the mission again!
$Button=Try again,MissionBegin,sw_m12

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
                                              <h2>SUCCESS!</h2>
<$PlaySound,itisDone2.wav>
<p>
You have repelled {sw_hades} forces, and have stopped his servants from
destroying Windy City.
<p>
It appears that you have selected the ~oWIND~. fury as your choice of Mentor.
<p><br>
<h2>You receive a message from the {sw_god2}</h2>
<p>
<i>Well, done Priest. You have proven to be a valuable tool. Aid me in suppressing
the other Furies, and there will be no stopping us in overtaking Nimbus together!</i>
<$Config,sw_m12=0>
<$Config,sw_m18=1>
<$Config,sw_difficulty1=0>
<$Config,sw_FuryTrapped=0>
<$Config,sw_droppedPriest=0>
$Button=Next Battle,MissionBegin,sw_m18



[END]
